# The Superpowers writing-plans skill's default output location. Plans are
# working files, not repository content. The plans directory only, not all of
# docs/superpowers/ — anything else the plugin writes there should surface as
# untracked noise rather than vanish silently.
#
# home/.gitignore carries the same entry for the global gitignore this repo
# installs; this one is what holds when the repository is cloned elsewhere.
docs/superpowers/plans/
